          "year": 2006,
          "date_decided": "2006-02-02",
          "holding": "The court held that standing for a guardianship petition under the Probate Act is governed by section 11-5(b) and that a fit parent who is willing and able to make day-to-day child-care decisions is entitled to custody, remanding for application of that standard.",
